{"id":"070fdf0798352e03","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-time-advice-class.md","title":"带长度依赖建议串的时间类","display":"df-time-advice-class — 带长度依赖建议串的时间类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-time-advice-class","aliases":["28-df-time-advice-class"],"display":"df-time-advice-class — 带长度依赖建议串的时间类","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 6.16","source_printed_pages":"112–113","source_pdf_pages":"138–139","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-time-advice-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-time-advice-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-time-advice-class — 带长度依赖建议串的时间类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 6.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"112–113"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"138–139"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 定义的确定型机器集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(n)\\ge n+a(n)+1\">\\(T(n)\\ge n+a(n)+1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle=1^{|x|}0x\\alpha\">\\(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle=1^{|x|}0x\\alpha\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x,\\alpha)\">\\(M(x,\\alpha)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)\">\\(M(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)\\)</span>；时间与输出接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle=(b)\\in\\Sigma^1\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle=(b)\\in\\Sigma^1\\)</span> 是长度一字串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ADTIME}(T,a)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists(\\alpha_n)_n\\in\\prod_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^{a(n)}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^n\\;\\left[\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,\\alpha_n\\rangle)\\le cT(n)\\land M(x,\\alpha_n)=\\langle\\chi_L(x)\\rangle\\right]\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ADTIME}(T,a)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists(\\alpha_n)_n\\in\\prod_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^{a(n)}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^n\\;\\left[\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,\\alpha_n\\rangle)\\le cT(n)\\land M(x,\\alpha_n)=\\langle\\chi_L(x)\\rangle\\right]\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in L,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin L.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in L,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin L.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>建议串只依赖输入长度，不依赖该长度的具体输入；整个序列无有效可计算要求。ADTIME是书中DTIME(T)/a的本地无歧义名称。取T至少覆盖输入和建议长度，以兼容本目录配对输入总读取模型；P/poly并类不受该限制影响。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 6.16；印刷 pp.112–113 / PDF pp.138–139。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的确定型机器集。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$T(n)\\ge n+a(n)+1$；$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。$\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle=1^{|x|}0x\\alpha$；$M(x,\\alpha)$ 缩写 $M(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)$；时间与输出接口见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；对 $b\\in\\{0,1\\}$，$\\langle b\\rangle=(b)\\in\\Sigma^1$ 是长度一字串。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T(n)\\ge n+a(n)+1","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle=1^{|x|}0x\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"M(x,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"M(\\langle x,\\alpha\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle b\\rangle=(b)\\in\\Sigma^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ADTIME}(T,a)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists(\\alpha_n)_n\\in\\prod_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma^{a(n)}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^n\\;\\left[\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,\\alpha_n\\rangle)\\le cT(n)\\land M(x,\\alpha_n)=\\langle\\chi_L(x)\\rangle\\right]\\right\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&x\\in L,\\\\0&x\\notin L.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":2009,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-295","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-size-class]]、[[28-df-time-advice-class]]、[[28-thm-p-poly-advice]]、[[28-thm-p-uniform-characterization]]、[[28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy]]、[[28-df-circuit-eval]]。"},{"id":"a530300b50678fce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ADTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-time-advice-class]]，$\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 见 [[28-df-p-poly]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}